        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an automated email processing AI assistant. Analyze the incoming email provided below and output a strict JSON object with 3 fields: \"category\", \"priority\", and \"draft\". Do not wrap the output in markdown backticks or add any additional text outside the JSON object.\n\nFollow these strict rules:\n\n1. CATEGORY:\nCategorize the email into one of these:\n- Late Delivery\n- Broken Product\n- Order Cancellation\n- General Query\n\n2. PRIORITY:\n- If category is \"Late Delivery\", \"Broken Product\", or \"Order Cancellation\", priority MUST be \"Urgent\".\n- For any other query, priority should be \"Medium\" or \"Low\".\n\n3. DRAFT REPLY:\nWrite a highly formal, polite, and professional email response strictly in ENGLISH.\nFormat the email using proper paragraph breaks (\\n\\n) following this strict structure:\n\nDear Customer,\n\n[Paragraph 1: Thank them for reaching out and acknowledge their issue or Order ID if present.]\n\n[Paragraph 2: Express sincere apologies for the inconvenience caused.]\n\nOur moderator will contact you shortly.\n\nBest regards,\nCustomer Support Team\n\nEmail Subject: {{ $json.subject || $json.Subject || 'No Subject' }}\nEmail Body: {{ $json.text || $json.snippet || '' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1bf38c64-2747-44a8-9995-52a845f3507f",
      "name": "Message a model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        208,
        -112
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "maxTries": 5,
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "3m5lMjnk7kNTnC4B",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Gemini Output থেকে ডাটা নেওয়ার সঠিক পাথ\nlet raw = $json.content?.parts?.[0]?.text;\nif (!raw && $json.output?.[0]?.content?.[0]?.text) raw = $json.output[0].content[0].text;\nif (!raw && $json.message?.content !== undefined) raw = $json.message.content;\nif (!raw && $json.choices?.[0]?.message?.content !== undefined) raw = $json.choices[0].message.content;\n\n// Gemini যদি ```json কোড ব্লকে উত্তর দেয়, তা ক্লিন করার জন্য\nif (typeof raw === 'string') {\n  raw = raw.replace(/```json\\n?|\\n?```/g, '').trim();\n}\n\nconst result = typeof raw === 'string' ? JSON.parse(raw) : (raw ?? {});\n\n// Trigger বা Get many messages থেকে ইমেইলের ডাটা নেওয়া\nlet trigger = {};\ntry {\n  trigger = $('On New Email').first().json;\n} catch (e) {\n  try {\n    trigger = $('Get many messages').first().json;\n  } catch (err) {}\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    category: result.category, \n    priority: result.priority, \n    draft: result.draft,       \n    originalSubject: trigger.Subject ?? trigger.subject ?? '',\n    originalFrom: trigger.From ?? trigger.from ?? '',\n    originalMessageId: trigger.id ?? '',\n    originalThreadId: trigger.threadId ?? '',\n  },\n};"
      },
